{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-06_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-06","title":"少見多怪","storyCode":"4-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6ae90a56bc9bc1bf410ffc36c4862684755900c579e55d9e0c5efdc8a2ffd57a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"羅德島一行來到分城廢墟，城裡的狀況令人在意。\n交談中，有什麼人引起了陳的注意，她獨自追去，一行想要跟上卻被整合運動阻攔。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是個陰沉的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"外交頻道呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"沒消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，這裡已經被烏薩斯拋棄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"廢城......嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果它已經成了整合運動的窩點，對於龍門而言，情況會變得越來越難以處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"離龍門太近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"如果碎骨的行動是接受了這裡的指揮，那我們放任不管的後果，確實不堪設想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過，切爾諾伯格的這個分城——究竟發生了什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"遭受天災之後是不可能移動這麼長的距離的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼，它會出現在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"從觀測得來的資料分析......這裡遭受過天災的餘波。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"分城是在移動到這裡後才被天災摧毀的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈。看來，羅德島還有些很不錯的天災信使嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"謹慎是正確的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"一路上都有散漫的整合運動埋伏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"簡直像是食腐野獸一樣盤踞在這廢城之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"真的令人有點不太舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我確認了座標，我們羅德島還得繼續深入——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但這個地形，我認為，不適合整個部隊一同行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來就是源石多生地帶了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（竟然是你。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳，你覺得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳，你去哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，跑得真快！那個難道是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也沒有看清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但我覺得那個身影確實是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得追上去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"停下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"居然選擇在這個時候攔住我們......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那個傢伙，不是一般的整合運動成員——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......從哪爬出來這麼多源石生物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那些源石生物......可能會爆炸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"讓羅德島的夥計們，都小心點！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊","陳"]}]}
